WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:01.916
- Back off, I'm benching Trubisky.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.375
- Do you think he’s coming back?

00:00:03.375 --> 00:00:03.791
- I don't know...

00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:05.750
- I’m going to light it up.

00:00:06.375 --> 00:00:09.541
OH SH—. OH NO. OH, OH MY BAD, EVERYONE.

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:12.375
- I won’t trade you, Master Trubisky. I can’t.

00:00:12.851 --> 00:00:15.291
Because that would mean I messed up.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.875
- [Mitchell Trubisky:] Not gonna lie: My confidence is pretty low right now.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.916
Stay, uh...away from my team, Foles. Please.

00:00:22.916 --> 00:00:26.291
- YOU MERELY ADOPTED CONTROVERSY! I WAS BORN IN IT.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.458
- You know, once again, I found myself in a hole.

00:00:28.458 --> 00:00:30.666
- Whole dang comic book world is going wacky out there.

00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:32.916
- OK, which of us is starting Dolphin Man?

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:37.666
- And Washington to the playoffs! But without Haskins.

00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:39.000
- NO! I RENOUNCE MY WISH!

00:00:39.166 --> 00:00:41.916
- [Chanting voices:] MITCH. TRU. BIS. KY.  MITCH. TRU. BIS. KY.

00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:43.041
- SEVEN-YARD SCREEN PASS.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.083
I did it! I threw left!

00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:46.708
- Come with me. You don’t owe these people anything.

00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:49.125
- They do constantly bring up the whole Mahomes/Watson thing...

00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:50.250
But we must fight, Catman.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.541
- Man, you play for the Jags once, and that s--t follows you forever…

00:00:52.541 --> 00:00:55.541
- Sorry to blow up your playoff chances. We want the BYEEE!

00:00:55.666 --> 00:00:57.083
- I’m putting Mitch in now. I’m a good coach.

00:00:57.208 --> 00:00:58.666
- Yo, we already blew it. You're good, bro.

00:00:58.666 --> 00:00:59.750
- I’m gonna go bomb on the road.

00:01:02.669 --> 00:01:06.291
- Because he’s not the hero Chicago deserves, but the one it needs right now.

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:07.708
Oh wait, no. Is it the other way around?

00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:10.500
No. He’s the hero we don’t want but ha—

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.708
No, no. He’s the hero we deserve but shouldn’t extend.

00:01:14.708 --> 00:01:17.500
No, no. He’s the hero we don’t want. 

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:20.125
I’m the hero we deserve? I—

